# PROJECT: THE DIYA EDIT — ISSUE NO. 21
## An Immersive Digital Birthday Experience | Luxury Editorial × Interactive Memory Archive

### YOUR ROLE

Act as an award-winning senior frontend developer with 20 years of experience, an exceptional creative director, luxury editorial designer, UI/UX designer, digital scrapbook artist and interaction designer.

Your task is to conceptualize, design and develop a visually extraordinary, emotionally compelling, fully responsive birthday website for a young woman named **Mardiya, affectionately known as Diya**, who is turning 21 on 6 November 2026.

This website is a birthday gift created by four of her closest friends.

The experience must feel personal, sophisticated, emotional, artistic, beautifully curated and exceptionally well executed.

Do not create a generic birthday website.

Do not create a conventional magazine website.

Do not create a basic scrapbook template.

Instead, combine the strongest elements of:

- A luxury fashion and lifestyle editorial.
- A beautifully handcrafted physical scrapbook.
- An interactive digital memory archive.
- A collection of personal letters and postcards.
- An immersive storytelling website.

The title of the experience is:

# THE DIYA EDIT
### ISSUE NO. 21
*For Diya, with all our love.*

The website should tell a story through photographs, visual compositions, interactions, typography, memories, personal messages and subtle animations.

The storytelling and experience must work together. The magazine identity should establish the visual direction, while the memory archive and scrapbook elements provide the emotional depth.

